culum for training NCI clinical and postdoctoral fellows.  aClosed-captioned.  aTitle from title screen.12aDNA Topoisomerasesxdrug effects22aAntineoplastic Agentsxpoisoning22aLymphoma 2aLecture 2aWebcast2 aNational Institutes of Health (U.S.)02aDNA topoisomerases and their poisoning by anticancer and antibacterial drugs.02aLymphomas.40uhttp://videocast.nih.gov/launch.asp?16876  aAUTH01338cas a2200433 a 9009267DNLM20260227091019.0cr|cn ||||||||900621c19899999nyu x p       0    0eng    a0896-2960l0896-2960  aCRPHE5  a(DNLM)SR0067533(s)  a(OCoLC)16994961  aDNLMcDNLMdDNLM  9United States00aW1bCR216ZEH10aCrit Rev Phys Rehabil Med2dnlm 0aCritical reviews in physical and rehabilitation medicine00aCritical reviews in physical and rehabilitation medicine.  aBoca Raton, FL :bCRC Press,cc1989-3 aNew York, Ny :bBegell House  av. :bill.  aFour no. a year  atextbtxt2rdacontent  aunmediatedbn2rdamedia  avolumebnc2rdacarrier0 aVol. 1, issue 1-  aTitle from cover.  aImprint varies.0 aPubMedbSelected citations only  aAlso issued online. 2aPhysical and Rehabilitation Medicine 2aRehabilitation 2aPeriodical 2aReview0 x2162-65534 uhttp://www.begellhouse.com/journals/critical-reviews-in-physical-and-rehabilitation-medicine.html  aAUTH01321cam a22003257a 101303755DNLM20260204153725.0070404s1908    bl c          000 0 por    a(OCoLC)257311523  aDNLMcDNLMdDNLM  9Brazil00aW6bP3 v.7481 box 1285 no.52 aInstituto de homoeopathia (São Paulo, Brazil)10aHahnemann e a homoeopathia de 1755 a 1908 :bhomenagem singela ao muito saber por tanto estudar /cInstituto de homoeopathia ... director geral Dr. J.F. de Magalhães Castro 10 de abril de 1908.  a[S. Paulo :bTypographia Vanorden & Co.,c1908]  a16 p. :bport. ;c23 cm.  atextbtxt2rdacontent  aunmediatedbn2rdamedia  avolumebnc2rdacarrier  aThe National Library of Medicine believes this item to be in the 