1946-10aEvolution and disease /cStephen Stearns, Yale University.  a[Bethesda, Md. :bNational Institutes of Health,c2007]  atwo-dimensional moving imagebtdi2rdacontent  acomputerbc2rdamedia  aonline resourcebcr2rdacarrier1 aEvolution and medicine lecture series  aTitle from screen banner.  aStreaming video (1 hr., 5 min. : sd., col.).  aRecorded May 2, 2007.3 a(CIT): Evolution and Medicine  Steve Stearns of Yale University will use evolutionary thinking to explain important medical issues, such as the prevalence of diabetes, maternal and infant health, and the development of live attenuated vaccines.   Lecture series presented by National Institute of General Medical Sciences, the Office of Science Education, and the National Human Genome Research Institute. For more information, visit  http://www.nigms.nih.gov/News/Meetings/EvolutionSeries2007.  aMode of access: World Wide Web.  aOpen-captioned.12aEvolution, Molecular22aDisease 2aLecture 2aWebcast2 aNational Institutes of Health (U.S.) 0aEvolution and medicine lecture series40uhttp://videocast.nih.gov/launch.asp?13801  aAUTH01237cas a22003977a 101247990DNLM20260209122540.0cr||n#||||||||050516c20049999un  x p       0    0ukr    a1814-9758l1814-9758  a(OCoLC)70121040  aDNLMcDNLMdDNLM0 aukraeng  9Ukraine00aW1bUK7300aUkrainica bioorganica acta :bUBA.30aUBA  aKyïv :bInstytut molekuli︠a︡rnoï biolohiï i henetyky NAN Ukraïny,cc2004-  av. :bill.  aTwo no. a year  atextbtxt2rdacontent  aunmediatedbn2rdamedia  avolumebnc2rdacarrier0 aT. 1, no. 1/2 (2004)-  aTitle from cover.  aLatest issue consulted: T. 2, no. 1 (2005).  aPrint issues ceased with v. 7, no. 2 (2009).  aAlso issued online.  aUkrainian or English.12aChemistry, Organic 2aPeriodical2 aInstytut molekuli︠a︡rnoï biolohiï i henetyky (Akademii︠a︡ nauk Ukraïny)0 x1814-97664 uhttps://bioorganica.com.ua/index.php/journal  aAUTH01554cgm a22004