ation not necessary2pda5DNLM12aDairy Productsxanalysis22aMilkxchemistry22aDairyingxstandards1 aBaginsky, A.q(Adolf),d1843-1918,ewriter of preface.1 aPeters, A. T.q(Albert Theodore),etranslator.1 aHiltner, R. S.,etranslator.  aAUTH06731ctm a2200877 a 9410471DNLM20260205111722.0940310s16uu    xx            000 0 ara    a(OCoLC)30980014  aDNLMcDNLMdDNLM00aWZ 225bC697c 160100a[Collection of 23 treatises].3 aMawāzīn al-aḥjār ʻalá rāʼy Balīnās3 aMufākharāt al-aḥjār3 aAthār al-ʻulwīyah3 aRāhib3 aTadbīr3 aKitāb al-iḥqāq min al-sabʻīn3 aNubdhat min kitāb al-iḥqāq min al-sabʻīn3 aRaḥmah al-kabīr3 aSirr al-maknūn3 aMujarradāt3 aQaṣīdat Khālid3 aFuṣūl3 aJannāt al-khuld3 aKitāb al-sirr al-sārr wa-sirr al-asrār3 aSirr al-sārr wa-sirr al-asrār3 aRisālat aflāṭūn  c[16--?]  a67 leaves, bound, (20 lines) :bpaper ;c21 cm.  atextbtxt2rdacontent  aunmediatedbn2rdamedia  avolumebnc2rdacarrier  aManuscript.  aArabic.  aItem [1] title from colophon (fol. 12a line 4); short form at start of text (fol.1b line 1): Kitāb al-sirr al-sārr.  aIn items [1], [2], [3], [14], [19], and [20] author identified as Jābir ibn al-Ḥayyān; see Sezgin, F. Gesch. Arab. Schrift., 1967, v.4, p.262 no.31, p.259 no.2, p.231 no.1, and p.255 no.18; item [14] (translation: Chapter taken from the Book of aphorisms) not recorded among works attributed to Jābir; other copies of items [1] and [19] found in NLM MS A33 fol.90a-120b and 161b-173b.5DNLM  aItems [7], [17], [21], [22] attributed to Jābir ibn Ḥayyān; see Sezgin, v.4, p.251 no.10, p.235, p.266, and p.96 no.5.  aIn item [4] author's name given (fol.20b line 15) as: Muḥammad ibn Zakarīyāʼ (i.e. Abū Bakr Muḥammad ibn Zakarīyāʼ al-Rāzī); apparently a unique copy of a work otherwise known through its Latin translation, Liber 70 praeceptorum (see Sezgin, v.4, p.282 no.3).  aIn item [5] author's name given (fol.22a line 8) as: Harmes (i.e. Hermes).  aIn item [6] author's name given (fol.24a line 12) as: al-Rāzī (i.e. Abū Bakr Muḥammad ibn Zakarīyāʼ al-Rāzī); see Sezgin, v.4, p.281 no.6.  aIn item [8] author's name given (fol.29a line 13) as: Arisātālis (i.e. Aristotle); see Sezgin, v.4, p.11.  aIn item [9] author's name given (fol.30b line 16, fol.31b line 15) as: Aflāṭūn (i.e. Plato); see Sezgin, v.4, p.98-100.  aItem [10] attributed to Abū Maslama al-Majrītī; see Sezgin, v.4, p.298 no.6.  aIn items [11] and [15] author's name given (fol.33b line 15; fol. 47b line 5) as: Al-Tughrāī (i.e. Muʻayyid al-Dīn al-Tughrāī)  aIn items [12] and [23] author's name given (fol.67a line 4; fol.38a line 1) as: Āghāthādhīmūn (i.e. Agathodaimon), an early Alexandrian alchemist); see Sezgin, v.4, p.47-48.  aIn item [13] author's name given (fol.41a line 9; fol.45a line 10) as: Rīsmūs (i.e. Zosimos); see Sezgin, v.4, p.73-77.  aIn items [16] and [18] author's name given (fol.51a line 4; fol.54b line 16) as: Kālid ibn Yazīd; see Sezgin, v.4, p.126 no.5 and 14.  aCopy undated; appearance of paper, handwriting, ink, etc., suggest a date ca. 17th cent.  aFol. 1a blank except for owners' notes and pencilled note regarding identification; owner's stamp on fol.1b; copious marginalia with some interlinear notes; catchwords; rubrications.5DNLM  aPaper lightly burnished; watermarked; neither laid nor chain lines visible; edges have been trimmed; from fol.41, some leaves dyed light gray.5DNLM  aItem [23] incomplete; text breaks off at bottom of fol.67b.5DNLM  aDescribed in: Schullian & Sommer. Cat. of incun. & MSS, 1950, A70.  aNLM microfilm copy shelved as: Film 48-126 no. 35DNLM0 a[1] Kitāb al-sirr al-sārr wa-sirr al-asrār (fol.1b-12a) -- [2] Jannāt al-khuld (fol.12a-13b) -- [3] Kitāb al-raḥmah al-kabīr (fol.13b-20b) -- [4] Nubdhat min kitāb al-iḥqāq min al-sabʻīn (fol.20b-22a) -- [5] Kitāb al-Harmis (fol.22a-24a) -- [6] Kitāb al-tadbīr (fol.24a-27b) -- [7] Kitāb al-rāhib (fol.28a-29a) -- [8] al-Athār al-ʻulwīyah lil-Aristātālīs (fol.29b-30b) -- [9] Risālat Aflāṭūn (fol.30b-31b) -- [10] Risālat mufākharat al-aḥjār (fol.31b-33b) -- [11] Min kalām al-Tughrāī (fol.33b-37b) -- [12] Kitāb Āghāthādhīmūn (fol.38a-41a) -- [13] Risālat Rīsmūs (fol.41a-45a) -- [14] Faṣl mustakhraj min Kitāb al-Fuṣūl (fol.45a-47b) -- [15] Nubdhat min qawl al-Tughrāī (fol.47b-51a) -- [16] Qaṣīdat Khālid (fol.51a-52b) -- [17] al-Mukhtārāt min al-mujarradāt (fol.52b-54b) -- [18] Masāʻil Khālid ibn Yazīd (fol.54b-57b) -- [19] Kitāb al-sirr al maknūn (fol.57b-63b) -- [20] Kitāb al-mawāzīn (fol.63b-64a) -- [21] Kitāb al-sirr al-maktūm, al-juzʼ al-thānī (fol.64ab) -- [22] Mawāzīn al-aḥjār ʻalá rāʼy Balīnās, al-juzʼ al-thānī (fol.64b-67a) -- [23] Kitāb Āghāthādhīmūn (fol.67ab).  aMicrofilm.m16--?bWashington, D.C. :cArmy Medical Library,d1948.e1 microfilm reel ; 35 mm.  aThe National Library of Medicine believes this item to be in the public domain.uhttps://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/mark/1.0/5DNLM  aPurchased in 1941 by Army Medical Library from A.S. Yahuda (ELS 1701 Med 120).5DNLM  aBound in soft brown leather with blind tooled designed formed of straight lines; no endpapers or pastedowns.5DNLM  aWill digitizec202602052pda5DNLM  aCondition reviewedc20260205lconservation not necessary2pda5DNLM12aMedicine, Arabic 2aManuscript0 aJābir ibn Ḥayyān.0 aHermes,cTrismegistus0 aPlato.1 aMajrīṭī, Maslamah ibn Aḥmad,d-1004?1 aṬughrāʼī, al-Ḥusayn ibn ʻAlī,d1061 or 1062-1121?0 aZosimos,cof Panopolis0 aKhālid ibn Yazīd al-Umawī,dactive 7th century.0 aAgathodaimon.0 aAristotle.1 aRāzī, Abū Bakr Muḥammad ibn Zakarīyā,d865?-925?1 aNational Library of Medicine (U.S.).kManuscript.nMS A 70  aAUTH01500cas a2200445 a 101621911DNLM20260227090918.0m     o  d        cr ||||