|u110715s2011    mdu313 ||||||fo   vleng    a(DNLM)CIT:16695  a(DNLM)CIT:16698  a(OCoLC)752782835  aDNLMcDNLMdDNLM  apcc  9United States10aW 26.52 aHealth Data Initiative Forumn(2ndd2011 :cBethesda, Md.)14aThe Health Data Initiative Forum 2011 (AM & PM session) /cU.S. Department of Health and Human Services and the Institute of Medicine.  a[Bethesda, Md. :bNational Institutes of Health,c2011]  a1 online resource (2 streaming video files (5 hr., 13 min.) :bsd., col.).  atwo-dimensional moving imagebtdi2rdacontent  acomputerbc2rdamedia  aonline resourcebcr2rdacarrier  aTitle from title screen.  aRecorded June 9, 2011.3 a(CIT): The U.S. Department of Health and Human Services and the Institute of Medicine will host The Health Data Initiative Forum on Thursday, June 9, 2011 to accelerate momentum for the public use of data and innovation to improve health.  The Forum, which builds on the success of The Community Health Data Initiative Forum: Harnessing the Power of Information to Improve Health, held in June 2010, will include a number of fast-paced demonstrations that present a range of tools and applications developed using health data, a series of discussion sessions, and a data and apps exposition where participants can interact with featured innovators, learn more about available data, and identify opportunities to expand upon current efforts.  aOpen-captioned.12aMedical Informatics Applications22aDelivery of Health Care22aQuality of Health Care22aStatistics as Topic 2aUnited States 2aConference Proceedings 2aWebcast40uhttp://videocast.nih.gov/launch.asp?1669540uhttp://videocast.nih.gov/launch.asp?16698  aAUTH01303cas a22004451  15910060RDNLM20260224111553.0cr|cn#||||||||821016c19439999enkar p       0    0eng    a0007-5167l0007-5167  aBZONAP  a(DNLM)B57940000(s)  a(OCoLC)01753468  aDNLMcDNLMdDNLM  9England00aW1bBU899K10aBull Zool Nomencl2dnlm04aThe Bulletin of zool