ess: World Wide Web.  aCopyright: This is a work of the United States Government. No copyright exists on this material. It may be disseminated freely.12aHIV-122aProtein Transport22aProteins 2aLecture 2aWebcast2 aNational Institutes of Health (U.S.)40uhttp://videocast.nih.gov/launch.asp?11748  aAUTH01430cgm a22004094a 101268675DNLM20260227150903.0m        z f      cr|cna||||||||vz|czaz|u060209s2003    mdu052 ||||||fs   vleng    a(DNLM)CIT:12417  a(OCoLC)154875820  aDNLMcDNLMdDNLM  apcc  9United States10aQU 45000aHuman Genome Project press conference /cNational Human Genome Research Institute and the Department of Energy.  a[Bethesda, Md. :bNational Institutes of Health,c2003]  atwo-dimensional moving imagebtdi2rdacontent  acomputerbc2rdamedia  aonline resourcebcr2rdacarrier  aTitle from screen banner (viewed May 31, 2007).  aStreaming video (51 min., 5 sec. : sd., col.).  aRecorded Apr. 14, 2003.  aMode of access: World Wide Web.  aCopyright: This is a work of the United States Government. No copyright exists on this material. It may be disseminated freely.  aOpen-captioned.22aHuman Genome Project.12aGenetic Research22aGenome, Human22aGenomics 2aWebcast2 aNational Human Genome Research Institute (U.S.)40uhttp://videocast.nih.gov/launch.asp?12417  aAUTH01378cgm a22004334a 101268685DNLM20260227152136.0m        z f      cr|cna||||||||vz|czaz|u060209s2005    mdu085 ||||||fs   vleng    a(DNLM)CIT:12428  a(OCoLC)154875888  aDNLMcDNLMdDNLM  apcc  9United States10aQU 4501 aBaxevanis, Andreas D.10aNucleotide and protein sequence analysis I /cAndy Baxevanis.  a[Bethesda, Md. :bNational Institutes of Health,c2005]  atwo-dimensional moving imagebtdi2rdacontent  acomputerbc2rdamedia  aonline resourcebcr2rdacarrier  aTitle from screen banner (viewed June 1, 2007).  aStreaming video (1 hr., 24 min., 37 sec. : sd., col.).  aRecorded Feb. 1, 2005.