 to expedite research in this area. The 1½ day hybrid workshop will explore state-of-the-art strategies for treating genetic diseases; the progress, pitfalls and lessons learned from neurological trials and treatments; considerations for designing and implementing therapies to treat the epilepsies; and crucial issues involved in genetic strategies beyond the technical development treatments.For more information go to https://event.roseliassociates.com/ninds-genetic-strategies/.  aClosed-captioned.  aDescription based on NIH CIT Videocast website; title from title screen (viewed September 22, 2025).12aEpilepsyxgenetics22aEpilepsyxtherapy22aGenetic Therapy 2aWebcast 2aConference Proceedings2 aNational Institute of Neurological Disorders and Stroke (U.S.),eissuing body.2 aNational Institutes of Health (U.S.),eissuing body.40uhttps://videocast.nih.gov/watch=5492340uhttps://videocast.nih.gov/watch=54924  aAUTH01653cas a2200433 i 101746324DNLM20260227090916.0m     o  d        cr||||||||||||190426c20199999fr || poo     |    0eng    a  2019243137  a2590-0412l2590-0412  a(OCoLC)1111757595  aDNLMbengerdad20260227cDNLMdDNLM  apcc  9France00aW110aRespir Med Res2dnlm00aRespiratory medicine and research. 1a[Issy-les-Moulineaux] :bElsevier Masson SAS,c[2019]-  a1 online resource  atextbtxt2rdacontent  acomputerbc2rdamedia  aonline resourcebcr2rdacarrier1 aBegan with Volume 75 (May 2019)1 aMEDLINEbv75, May 2019-0 aPubMedbv75, May 2019-  aArticles are published as received and cumulated into volumes.  a"Official journal of the French Society of Respiratory Diseases (Société de pneumologie de langue française - SPLF)"  aDescription based on: Volume 75 (May 2019); title from title screen (ScienceDirect, viewed August 2, 2019).  aLatest issue consulted: Volume 76 (November 2019) (viewed August 2, 2019).12aLung Diseases22aRespiratory System 2aPeriodical2 aSociété de pneumologie de