ndings by leading BIRCWH Scholars. A special "Innovation Talk" to celebrate the 20th anniversary of the BIRCWH program will close the event.  aClosed-captioned.  aDescription based on NIH CIT Videocast website; title from title screen (viewed March 2, 2021).12aVocational Guidance12aBiomedical Research22aWomen22aAnniversaries and Special Events22aWomen's Health 2aWebcast 2aConference Proceedings2 aNational Institutes of Health (U.S.).bOffice of Research on Women's Health,esponsoring body. 0aRuth L. Kirschstein lecture ;v4th40uhttps://videocast.nih.gov/watch=40059  aAUTH01530cas a2200445   8009022DNLM20260227090951.0cr|cn#||||||||800918c19809999sp br p       0    0spa    a0211-139Xl0211-139X  aREGGDU  a(DNLM)R33290000(s)  a(OCoLC)06869221  aDNLMcDNLMdDNLM  9Spain00aW1bRE534G10aRev Esp Geriatr Gerontol2dnlm 0aRev́ista española de geriatrica gerontologia00aRevista española de geriatría y gerontología.  a[Madrid]bSociedad Española de Gerontología y Geriatriía.3 aMadrid :bElsevier España  av.bill.  aBimonthly  atextbtxt2rdacontent  aunmediatedbn2rdamedia  avolumebnc2rdacarrier0 at. 15-    enero/feb. 1980-  aImprint varies.1 aMEDLINEbv43n1, Jan./Feb. 2008-0 aPubMedbv43n1, Jan./Feb. 2008-  aSubscription required for full-text online access.  aOfficial organ of the Sociedad Española de Gerontología y Geriatría. 2aGeriatrics 2aPeriodical2 aSociedad Española de Gerontología y Geriatría.0 x1578-174700tRevista española de gerontología y geriatríax0210-6175w(OCoLC)042499094 uhttps://www.sciencedirect.com/journal/revista-espanola-de-geriatria-y-gerontologia  aAUTH01410cas a2200433 a 101530546DNLM20260227090907.0cr||||||||||||100218c20109999ne qr p       0    0eng    a  2010205359  a1877-5756l1877-5756  a(OCoLC)606139797  aEQOcEQOdDLCdDNLM  apcc  9Netherlands00aW1bSE99C10aSex Reprod Healthc2dnlm00aSexual & reproductive healthcare :boff