roscopy in different areas of biomedical sciences such as cell biology, immunology, neuroscience, stem cells and tumor biology. The program includes two days of lectures from top scientists in the field, which is open to the NIH intramural community.  John J. Condeelis (Einstein Coll. of Medicine), Peter Friedl (NCMLS Nijmegen (NL)), Dai Fukumura (Mass General Hospital), Xingde Li (Johns Hopkins University), Michael J. Levene (Yale School of engineering),  Roberto Weigert (NIH-NIDCR), Marshall H. Montrose (University of Cincinnati)John J. Lemasters, University South Carolina.  aMode of access: World Wide Web.  aOpen-captioned.12aMicroscopy, Fluorescence, Multiphoton 2aConference Proceedings 2aWebcast2 aNational Institute of Dental and Craniofacial Research (U.S.)40uhttp://videocast.nih.gov/launch.asp?1665940uhttp://videocast.nih.gov/launch.asp?16669  aAUTH01122cam a2200313 i 45000010017000000030005000170050017000220080041000390350022000800400035001020420008001370440018001450600024001631000062001872450093002492640067003423000060004093360026004693370028004953380027005235000017005505000061005675010060006285040041006886500036007296500010007657300024007759990009007999918787488106676DNLM20260212175934.0240319r19551955mauaf    b    000 0 eng    a(OCoLC)1540314720  aDNLMbengerdad20260212dDNLM  apcc  9United States00aW7bB367c v.3 no.171 aBean, William B.q(William Bennett),d1909-1989,eauthor.14aThe changing incidence of certain vascular lesions of the skin with ageing /cW.B. Bean. 1a[Boston, Massachusetts] :b[publisher not identified],c[1955]  apages 80-87, 1 page of plates :billustrations ;c20 cm  atextbtxt2rdacontent  aunmediatedbn2rdamedia  avolumebnc2rdacarrier  aCover title.  a"Reprinted from Ciba Foundation coll. ageing, 1, 80-87."  aNLM copy, bound 17th in a volume of 92 pamphlets.5DNLM  aIncludes bibliographical references.12aVascular Diseasesxepidemiology22aAging0 aColloquia on aging.