ubjects Committee, and Chairman of the University's Bioethics Advisory Committee.  aMode of access: World Wide Web.  aCopyright: This is a work of the United States Government. No copyright exists on this material. It may be disseminated freely.12aNontherapeutic Human Experimentation22aChild22aEthics, Research22aResearch Subjects 2aWebcast2 aNational Institutes of Health (U.S.)40uhttp://videocast.nih.gov/launch.asp?11114  aAUTH01429cgm a22004334a 101267959DNLM20260227145946.0m        z f      cr|cna||||||||vz|czaz|u060209s2002    mdu059 ||||||fs   vleng    a(DNLM)CIT:11113  a(OCoLC)68207250  aDNLMcDNLMdDNLM  apcc  9United States10aWB 3101 aMeier, Diane E.10aEnd of life issues /cDiane Meier.  a[Bethesda, Md. :bNational Institutes of Health,c2002]  atwo-dimensional moving imagebtdi2rdacontent  acomputerbc2rdamedia  aonline resourcebcr2rdacarrier  aTitle from screen banner (viewed Apr. 13, 2006).  aStreaming video (58 min., 9 sec. : sd., col.).  aRecorded Apr. 3, 2002.  aMode of access: World Wide Web.  aCopyright: This is a work of the United States Government. No copyright exists on this material. It may be disseminated freely.  aOpen-captioned.12aTerminal Care22aCommunication22aDecision Making22aPhysician-Patient Relations22aProfessional-Family Relations 2aWebcast2 aNational Institutes of Health (U.S.)40uhttp://videocast.nih.gov/launch.asp?11113  aAUTH01331cas a2200421 a 101553221DNLM20260227090914.0m        |        cr#|||||||||||100720c20109999gw || poo     |    0ger    a  2011243568  a2190-2100l2190-2100  a(OCoLC)648915053  aHNKcHNKdDNLM0 agerbeng  apcc  9Germany10aW1  aRT1b.H4510aHeilberufeScience2dnlm00aHeilberufeSCIENCE.13aHeilberufe SCIENCE  a[Munich, Germany] :bUrban & Vogel3 a[New York] :bSpringer  a4 times a year  atextbtxt2rdacontent  acomputerbc2rdamedia  aonline resourcebcr2rdacarrier1 aBegan with vol.