symptom controlx1056-4950w(DLC)   93656271w(OCoLC)237255144 uhttp://www.tandfonline.com/loi/ippc20  aAUTH01882cas a2200445 a 101643929DNLM20260227090916.0m     o  d        cr||||||||||||141021c20159999sz || poo     0    0eng    a  2017205854  a1058859079  a2198-7335l2198-7335  a(OCoLC)904796850  z(OCoLC)1058859079  aHKPbengepnd20260227dOCLCOdOCLCFdOCLCQdUABdDLCdOCLCQdU3WdREBdOCLCQdDEHBZdAU@dLVTdDNLM  apcc  9Switzerland00aBF199 4aBF199b.A3300aW110aAdapt Human Behav Physiol2dnlm00aAdaptive human behavior and physiology.  aCham, Switzerland :bSpringer Nature,c[2015]-  a1 online resource  atextbtxt2rdacontent  acomputerbc2rdamedia  aonline resourcebcr2rdacarrier1 aBegan with Volume 1, issue 1 (March 2015)0 aPubMedbSelected citations only  a"This international scientific journal publishes theoretical and empirical studies which explore and examine all aspects of adaptive human behavior. A sampling of the topics covered includes cooperation, affiliation and bonding, competition and aggression, sex and relationships, parenting and decision-making, and many more." --About this journal, viewed SpringerLink 24 July 2015.  aDescription based on: Volume 1, issue 1 (March 2015); title from journal homepage (SpringerLink, viewed February 19, 2019).  aLatest issue consulted: Volume 4, issue 4 (December 2018) (viewed February 19, 2019).12aAdaptation, Psychological22aBehaviorxphysiology22aBehaviorism 2aPeriodical40uhttps://link.springer.com/journal/40750  aAUTH01701cas a2200517 a 9710011DNLM20260227091052.0cr|cn ||||||||970807c19979999nyubr p       0    0eng    asn 96003702 0 a1091-8531l1091-8531  a(DNLM)SR0091387(s)  a(OCoLC)35987987  aNSDPcNSDPdDNLM  amsc  9United States00aW1bJO53210aJ AAPOS2dnlm00aJournal of AAPOS :bthe official publication of the American Association for Pediatric Ophthalmology and Strabismus /cAmerican Association for Pediatric