  a(OCoLC)173201679  aDNLMcDNLMdDNLM  apcc  9United States10aQZ 2661 aKensler, Thomas.10aCancer chemoprevention with glucosinolate rich broccoli sprouts /cThomas Kensler.  a[Bethesda, Md. :bNational Institutes of Health,c2007]  atwo-dimensional moving imagebtdi2rdacontent  acomputerbc2rdamedia  aonline resourcebcr2rdacarrier1 aOCCAM monthly lecture series  aTitle from screen banner (viewed Sept. 17, 2007).  aStreaming video (1 hr., 14 min. : sd., col.).  aRecorded Aug. 8, 2007.3 a(CIT): The NCI's Office of Cancer Complementary and Alternative Medicine (OCCAM) invites you to view its monthly lecture series.  With the goal of informing the National Cancer Institute (NCI) community about the variety of ongoing research in cancer and complementary and alternative medicine (CAM), NCI's Office of Cancer Complementary and Alternative Medicine (OCCAM) has created a monthly lecture series on cancer CAM. These hour long lectures, occurring from 10 a.m. - 11 a.m. on the second Wednesday of each month, will feature a fifty minute presentation on a cancer CAM topic and allow ten minutes for questions.  aMode of access: World Wide Web.  aOpen-captioned.12aNeoplasmsxdiet therapy22aBrassica22aGlucosinolatesxtherapeutic use22aNeoplasmsxprevention & control 2aLecture 2aWebcast2 aNational Cancer Institute (U.S.).bOffice of Cancer Complementary and Alternative Medicine. 0aOCCAM monthly lecture series40uhttp://videocast.nih.gov/launch.asp?14000  aAUTH01132cas a2200409   7702681DNLM20260227090922.0cr|cn#||||||||770407c19779999nyuqr         0    0eng    a0146-7239l0146-7239  aMOEMDJ  a(DNLM)M49560000(s)  a(OCoLC)02861856  aDNLMcDNLMdDNLM  9United States00aW1bMO94410aMotiv Emot2dnlm 0aMotivation and emotion00aMotivation and emotion.  aNew York,bPlenum Press.3 31999- :aNew York, NY :bKluwer Academic/Plenum Publishers  av.bill.  aBimonthly,b2014-  aQuarterly,b1977-2013  at