A ... [et al.].  a[Bethesda, Md. :bNational Institutes of Health,c2008]  atwo-dimensional moving imagebtdi2rdacontent  acomputerbc2rdamedia  aonline resourcebcr2rdacarrier  aTitle from screen banner (viewed June 26, 2009).  aStreaming video (4 hr., 29 min. : sd., col.).  aRecorded Sept. 23, 2008.3 a(CIT): In this final year of the Mammalian Gene Collection, the speakers at the MGC symposium will highlight significant biomedical studies and advances in their laboratories that have been aided by the unrestricted access of the scientific community to the MGC's high-quality full-CDS cDNA clones and sequences. For more information, click here: http://web.ncifcrf.gov/events/mge/default.asp.  aMode of access: World Wide Web.  aOpen-captioned.12aGene Library12aMammalsxgenetics22aGenome 2aConference Proceedings 2aWebcast40uhttp://videocast.nih.gov/launch.asp?14665  aAUTH01540cas a2200421 i 101718385DNLM20260226080006.0m     o  d        cr||||||||||||171218d20172023mv || poo     |    0eng    a  2018243048  a2537-6381l2537-6381  a(OCoLC)1029854308  aDNLMbengerdad20260226cDNLMdDNLM  apcc  9Moldova00aW1bCU5304aThe Moldovan medical journal. 1aChişinău, the Republic of Moldova :bScientific Medical Association of Moldova,c[2017]-  a1 online resource  aQuarterly  atextbtxt2rdacontent  acomputerbc2rdamedia  aonline resourcebcr2rdacarrier1 aBegan with Vol. 60, No. 1 (February 2017); ceased with 2023.  aAlso issued in print.  aThe publication of the Scientific Medical Association of Moldova.  aDescription based on: Vol. 60, No. 1 (February 2017); title from journal home page (publisher's website, viewed February 20, 2018).  aLatest issue consulted: Vol. 60, No. 4 (December 2017) (viewed February 20, 2018).12aMedicine 2aMoldova 2aPeriodical2 aScientific Medical Association of Moldova,eissuing body.0 x2537-637300tCurier medicalx1857-0666w(OCoLC)3256567140uhttps://rep