rtise freely and to inspire people and enrich lives. Circulating Now conveys the vitality of medical history in our 21st-century world: its relevance and importance for research, teaching, and learning about the human condition. Circulating Now evokes the living quality of the NLM's historical collections and the stories they offer about the experience of health and disease across ten centuries and around the world.  aDescription based on online resource; title from homepage (viewed February 26, 2026).22aNational Library of Medicine (U.S.)12aLibraries, Medical22aHistory of Medicine22aLibrary Services 2aBlog40uhttp://circulatingnow.nlm.nih.gov/  aAUTH01428cas a2200433   0051012DNLM20260225133136.0cr|cn#||||||||660629c19669999txumr         0||| 0eng    a   19000038 -3223  a0040-4470l0040-4470  aTXMDAX  a(DNLM)T06880000(s)  a(OCoLC)01644122  aDNLMcDNLMdDNLM  9United States00aW1bTE78710aTex Med2dnlm00aTexas medicine.  aAustin,bTexas Medical Assn.  av.billus., ports.  aMonthly  atextbtxt2rdacontent  aunmediatedbn2rdamedia  avolumebnc2rdacarrier0 av. 62, no. 5-       May 1966-1 aMEDLINEbv61n9, Sept. 1965-v117n1, Dec. 20210 aPubMedbv61n9, Sept. 1965-v117n1, Dec. 20211 aIndex medicus  aAlso issued online.  3Vol. 86, no. 5 (MAY 1990)c19900914fNotice not publishedlPrinted on acid-free paperxFurther review is required to determine exactly when acid-free paper was first used for this title 2aMedicine 2aPeriodical2 aTexas Medical Association.0 x1938-322300tTexas state journal of medicinex0096-7165w(DLC)   45027713w(OCoLC)17793204 uhttp://www.texmed.org/TexasMedicine/  aAUTH02514cas a2200589   7508397DNLM20260227090914.0cr|cn#||||||||750815c19369999mautr m       0    0eng    ae  37000123 zsn 80011998z 2004275186  a0037-976Xl0037-976X  aMSCDA7  a(DNLM)M47060000(s)  a(OCoLC)01765889  aDNLMcDNLMdDNLM  ansdp  9United States00aW1bMO569RK10aMonogr Soc 