 which working groups of scientists, clinicians, advocates, and people living with ALS will present an overview of highest priorities for research that will lead to the discovery of effective interventions for the diagnosis, treatment, management, prevention, or cure of ALS.   Meeting website: https://als-strategic-plan.com  Engagement form: https://forms.office.com/g/LYYHjMfsPJ.  aClosed-captioned.  aDescription based on online resource; title from title screen (viewed February 28, 2024).12aAmyotrophic Lateral Sclerosis22aBiomedical Research22aStrategic Planning 2aConference Proceedings 2aWebcast2 aNational Institute of Neurological Disorders and Stroke (U.S.),eissuing body.40uhttps://videocast.nih.gov/watch=4635440uhttps://videocast.nih.gov/watch=46356  aAUTH01510cas a2200469   0055107DNLM20260227090927.0cr|cnu||||||||660824c19669999mau x         0    0eng    asf 80000704 zsn 79004707  a0022-3484l0022-3484  aJPDRAY  a(DNLM)J34120000(s)  a(OCoLC)01754721  aDNLMcDNLMdDNLM  9United States00aW1bJO828K10aJ Periodontal Res2dnlm00aJournal of periodontal research.  aCopenhagen :bMunksgaard International Publishers3 aMalden, MA :bWiley-Blackwell  av.billus.  aSix no. a year,b2000-  aSix no. a year,b199?-1996  aEight no. a year,b1997-1999  atextbtxt2rdacontent  aunmediatedbn2rdamedia  avolumebnc2rdacarrier0 av. 1-       1966-1 aMEDLINEbv1, 1966-0 aPubMedbv1, 1966-1 aIndex to dental literaturebv1, 1966-v35n1, Feb. 20001 aIndex medicus  aAlso issued online.  3Vol. 15, no. 1 (1980)c19921022fNotice not publishedlPrinted on acid-free paper 2aPeriodontics 2aPeriodical1 tJournal of periodontal research. Supplementx0075-4331w(OCoLC)016956270 x1600-07654 uhttp://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/journal/10.1111/(ISSN)1600-0765  aAUTH01713cas a2200505   0372557DNLM20260227090920.0cr|cn ||||||||731018c19569999nyumr p       0||| 0eng    a   59032521 zsn 78004266  a0