al Latino and Asian American Study (NLAAS) as well as the National Comorbidity Survey - Replication (NCS-R), provides data on the distributions, correlates, and risk factors of mental disorders among African American, Latino, and Asian American racial and ethnic subgroups.  aMode of access: World Wide Web.  aOpen-captioned.12aEthnicity.12aMental Health Services22aHealth Services Accessibility22aSocioeconomic Factors. 2aLecture 2aWebcast2 aNational Institutes of Health (U.S.) 0aMental health disparities speaker series40uhttp://videocast.nih.gov/launch.asp?14003  aAUTH01234cas a2200385 i 101639829DNLM20260227090919.0m     o  d        cr||||||||||||140709c20149999ne || poo     0    0eng    a  2015243170  a2215-0161l2215-0161  a(OCoLC)883675343  aCNCGMbengerdad20260227cCNCGMdCOOdDNLM  apcc  9Netherlands00aW110aMethodsX2dnlm00aMethodsX. 1aAmsterdam :bElsevier B.V.,c[2014]-  a1 online resource.  atextbtxt2rdacontent  acomputerbc2rdamedia  aonline resourcebcr2rdacarrier1 aBegan with 1 (2014).0 aPubMedbv1, 2014-0 aPMC  aDescription based on: 1 (2014); title from PDF running title (publisher's Web site, viewed Apr. 22, 2015).  aLatest issue consulted: 2 (2015) (viewed Apr. 2015).12aClinical Laboratory Techniques22aMedical Laboratory Science40uhttp://www.sciencedirect.com/science/journal/2215016140uhttps://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/journals/?term=101639829  aAUTH01520cas a22004334a 101152152DNLM20260227090918.0m        d        cr|cnu||||||||020815c19uu9999enkuu pss|    0    0eng    a  2003244904  a1476-0711l1476-0711  a(OCoLC)51164619  aOUNcOUNdNLMdDNLM  alcdanlmcopyc  9England10aW110aAnn Clin Microbiol Antimicrob2dnlm00aAnnals of clinical microbiology and antimicrobials.1 iSource code title:aACMA  aLondon :bBioMed Central,c[2002]-  atextbtxt2rdacontent  acomputerbc2rdamedia  aonline resourcebcr2rdacarrier0 aVol. 1, issue 1 (2002)-