ractice in psychedelic therapy. In your first few weeks, you work with participants who have vastly different experiences: One participant expresses mystical insights, another spends the day shaking and trembling, a third makes peace with a deceased father, the fourth dives deep into grief and sobs for hours, and the last feels connected to their true self for the first time in their life but isn't sure what to do about it"--cProvided by publisher.12aDepressive Disorderxtherapy22aHallucinogensxtherapeutic use22aPsychotherapyxmethods1 aBelser, Alexc(Psychedelic psychologist)eauthor.  aAUTH00969cam a22002777i 4500001001000000003000500010005001700015008004100032040003500073044001000108060003300118100003000151245003600181250001100217264008100228300003300309336002600342337002800368338002700396490007200423650001400495655002400509830007400533830007500607999000900682101610309DNLM20260209113145.0130612s1935    cc a   j      000 0 chi    aDNLMbengerdad20260209dDNLM  9China00aW6bP3 v.7481 box 1777 no.201 aCheng, Hanzhang,eauthor.10aYin liao /cCheng Hanzhang zhu.  a3 ban. 1aShanghai :bShang wu yin shu guan fa xing,cMinguo 24 nian 6 yue [June 1935]  a4, 62 pages :billustrations  atextbtxt2rdacontent  aunmediatedbn2rdamedia  avolumebnc2rdacarrier1 aXiao xue sheng wen ku ;vdi 1 ji, di 195 ce, sheng li wei sheng lei12aBeverages 2aJuvenile Literature 0aXiao xue sheng wen ku (Shang wu yin shu guan).nDi 1 ji ;vdi 195 ce. 0aXiao xue sheng wen ku (Shang wu yin shu guan).pSheng li wei sheng lei  aAUTH01943nam a2200397 i 9918987883506676DNLM20260220115615.0230609s2025    moua     b    001 0 eng    a044311708Xqpaperback  a9780443117084qpaperback  a(OCoLC)1381444796  aYDXbengerdacYDXdOCLCOdCQCdOCLCOdYDX  apcc  9United States 4aSF756.4b.P74 202500aSF 756.404a636.089068223/eng/202405021 aPrendergast, Heather,eauthor.10aFront office management for the veterinary team10aPractice