olicies. Mandatory TFA policies are currently in effect for 3.4 billion people in 60 countries (43% of the world population); of these, 43 countries have best-practice policies in effect, covering 2.8 billion people (36% of the world population). The WHO Validation Programme for Trans fat Elimination recognizes and acknowledges country success in implementation of best-practice policy, along with effective monitoring and enforcement. The programme has potential to amplify interest among countries and accelerate progress towards the global elimination goal by 2023.  aDescription based on online resource; title from PDF title page (viewed on date)12aTrans Fatty Acidsxadverse effects12aNutrition Policy22aGlobal Health22aFood Supplyxlegislation & jurisprudence22aNoncommunicable Diseasesxprevention & control2 aWorld Health Organization.bDepartment of Nutrition and Food Safety,eauthor.2 aWorld Health Organization,eissuing body.40uhttps://iris.who.int/handle/10665/365617  aAUTH00947nam a2200289 a 45000010017000000030005000170050017000220080041000390350020000800400065001000440010001650600033001752450110002082460016003182500014003342600053003483000025004013360026004263370028004523380027004805000022005076500033005296500034005626500021005967100031006179990009006489919227656306676DNLM20260210092645.0070311s1974    cc            000 0 chi    a(OCoLC)85833796  aH2KbengcH2KdOCLCFdOCLCOdOCLCQdX2QdOCLCQdOCLCOdOCLCQ  9China00aW6bP3 v.7481 box 5702 no.2000aZen yang zheng que shi yong qing mei su, lian mei su /cShanghai di yi yi xue yuan hua shan yi yuan bian.30aLian mei su  aDi 1 ban.  aBeijing :bRen min wei sheng chu ban she,c1974.  a2, 31 pages ;c19 cm  atextbtxt2rdacontent  aunmediatedbn2rdamedia  avolumebnc2rdacarrier  aTitle from cover.12aPenicillinsxtherapeutic use12aStreptomycinxtherapeutic use22aHealth Education2 aHua Shan yi yuan,eeditor.  aAUTH00891nam a2200265 i 45000010017000000030